---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WhatsAppCTA from '../../../components/conversion/WhatsAppCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Equitable Road Paving · Precinct 4 Issue"
  description="Lupe Negrete's plan for fair road paving in Precinct 4, Maverick County: asphalt, pothole repair, and stormwater drainage for Loma Bonita and colonias."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white py-14 md:py-20 border-b-4 border-red-cta">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-4">
      <a href="/en/issues/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 hover:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        ← Back to all issues
      </a>
      <div class="inline-block bg-red-cta/20 border border-red-cta/40 text-red-logo text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Key Issue · Infrastructure
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-heading text-white leading-tight">
        Fair Streets for All of Precinct 4
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg">
        Quality asphalt and stormwater drainage so no neighborhood is left stranded in the mud after rainstorms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- AI-optimized summary answer -->
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border-l-8 border-red-cta border-y border-r border-slate-200 shadow-md space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-950">
        What will Lupe Negrete do about road conditions in Precinct 4?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Lupe Negrete will demand an immediate rebalancing of Maverick County’s public works budget so that colonias like Loma Bonita receive proportional investments in asphalt paving and stormwater drainage, ending historical neglect compared to central Eagle Pass.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Local Problem -->
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-800 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">The Real Problem in Our Colonias</h2>
      <p>
        For decades, residents of Precinct 4 have navigated rough unpaved roads and severe potholes that damage vehicle suspensions, wear down tires, and block school buses and emergency vehicles during rainy weather.
      </p>
      <p>
        While county funds are concentrated in central city projects, peripheral colonias are left behind. Local residents pay their county taxes on time and deserve the exact same standard of roadway infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Photo on site -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
      <img
        src="/images/candidate-assembly.png"
        alt="Lupe Negrete speaking with families at a street meeting in Loma Bonita"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-200 text-center">
        Lupe Negrete meeting with Precinct 4 residents to discuss road paving and drainage priorities.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Commitments -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-navy-950">Lupe Negrete’s Concrete Commitments</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-cta font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Master Paving Plan for Underserved Colonias</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Prioritizing major thoroughfares and school bus routes in Loma Bonita and surrounding neighborhoods.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-cta font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Permanent Pothole and Maintenance Crews</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Rapid turnaround for neighborhood road damage reports rather than waiting months for basic repairs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-red-50 text-red-cta font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy-950 text-base">Integrated Stormwater Drainage</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Proper leveling, culverts, and water runoff management to prevent flash flood damage to fresh asphalt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contextual WhatsApp Action -->
    <div class="bg-navy-900 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl text-center space-y-6 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black font-heading text-white">
        Does your street need urgent road repairs?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Message us on WhatsApp to log your street location on our campaign priority map.
      </p>
      <div>
        <WhatsAppCTA
          source="pavimentacion"
          lang="en"
          label="Report my street on WhatsApp"
          variant="primary"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
      <a href="/en/issues/lighting/" class="text-navy-900 hover:text-red-cta flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Next: Lighting & Safety</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/issues/audit/" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-navy-900">
        View Budget Audit proposal →
      </a>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>
